 rest. What to Expect: Complimentary coffee and light breakfast snacks Oppo
 rtunity to network with professionals from diverse industries Casual\, fri
 endly atmosphere to make new contacts & swap business cards A fun raffle o
 pportunity! This is the perfect chance to start your day meeting new peopl
 e\, sharing ideas\, and growing your professional circle. Not a Wake Fores
 t Area Chamber member? This event requires a personal invitation from a cu
 rrent member or staff. Reach out to us to get on the list!
