DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270203T063000
UID:8033796d0eea6f571ef1e4cf265187c3@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Prepare to be at the epicenter of economic transformation at t
 he 2027 Economic Development Forum\, presented by Cameron Family\, CPAs\, 
 this is the must-attend event of the year for anyone with a stake in our r
 egion's future. Co-hosted by the Wake Forest Business Industry Partnership
  and the Wake Forest Area Chamber\, this landmark gathering will bring tog
 ether the most influential minds shaping our economic landscape. A Glimpse
  into the Future Keynote speaker Ted Abernathy will unveil a compelling fo
 recast of the Triangle's next two decades. With his vast experience spanni
 ng 35 years and work across dozens of states\, Abernathy will provide unpa
 ralleled insights into: 📐The Triangle's remarkable progress 👩‍🎓
 Emerging talent pipelines 💼Strategies for adaptation 📈Critical trend
 s shaping our economic future Networking Powerhouse This forum is more tha
 n just a presentation\; it's a nexus of opportunity. Rub shoulders over a 
 provided breakfast and coffee with: 🪙Elected officials 🧑‍💼Busin
 ess owners
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/2027-econom
 ic-development-forum-presented-by-cameron-family-cpas
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
