 dvance your career\, strengthen your personal goals\, or simply find a lit
 tle more direction and motivation\, this workshop is designed to help you 
 envision what's next. Take time to reflect on where you are\, get intentio
 nal about where you want to go\, and bring your goals to life through crea
 tivity\, conversation\, and connection with other like-minded women. You'l
 l leave with a personalized vision board\, fresh inspiration\, and a renew
 ed sense of purpose to make your goals a reality. Because big things happe
 n when women dream big and support one another! Thank you to North State B
 ank for sponsoring our Brunch treats! Thank you to Bright path for Sponsor
 ing our Vision Boards!
